Package: getsploit
Version: 3.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: python, python-pip, rust, make, pkg-config
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/vulnersCom/getsploit
Description: Command-line search tool for exploits and vulnerabilities
 getsploit is a CLI utility that searches for exploits, vulnerabilities,
 and public exploits using the Vulners database. Fast, flexible, and
 scriptable.
